  "short_answer": "In the 'Address Book' you can create your own groups of participants. This way you can invite people or organisations who match certain criteria (e.g. 'male', and 'older than 21'). Every potential participant is stored as a contact in the address book along with an unlimited list of editable attributes. You can save any contact to your address book as long as they have an identifier ('Name') and an email address.",
